cs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472010/extras/140f79cbd2bd9c202db52f8714afda3f.mp4?t=1752486452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Political Landscape:</strong> The fjord is home to rival clans, each with their own culture, ambitions, and secrets. Navigate the complex relations as your choices influence the balance of power and the fate of the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm Reclamation &amp; Base Building:</strong> Restore abandoned farms affected by the plague, turning them into thriving settlements. Each reclaimed farm provides unique challenges, puzzles, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472010/extras/065a194e3caf40db9f6d0be1c51385f1.poster.avif?t=1752486452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472010/extras/065a194e3caf40db9f6d0be1c51385f1.webm?t=1752486452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472010/extras/065a194e3caf40db9f6d0be1c51385f1.mp4?t=1752486452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Gameplay:</strong> Experience Eydigard solo or team up with up to 6 players. Combine shapeshifting skills, tactics, and exploration to confront greater challenges and unravel the mysteries of the plague together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472010/extras/c97f5b0c406f972a8983cab9017ba931.poster.avif?t=1752486452\" ><source src=\"